title: mf repo give-back
tags: [[CLI command]] Sync
kind: reference
summary: Send the selected borrowed copy home, and delete it

Checks the copy's store, copies its `internal/` back over the remote's — the remote keeps
its own `config.json`, configuration and backups —, lifts the mark and deletes the copy.
Refused, the copy kept and loaded, when the remote is no longer marked as lent to it
([[Cross-machine sync]]).
